        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBN2006/24, Double Nobe Solid Brass 24\" Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana's 24\" Double Towel Bar has concealed screw mounting for a sleek look. It is available satin nickel and polished chrome finishes. The beautifully contemporary brackets of the Nobe Towel Bar makes it perfect for modern homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2006_24-specifications.gif?v=1704354643\" width=\"483\" height=\"186\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBN2006/24 24\" Double Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/24-inch-sobe-towel-bar-deltana-bbs2003-24\"><b>Deltana 24\" Nobe Series Single Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\nShop other <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBN Nobe Series\"><b>Deltana Nobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Nobe Double Bath Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 23-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Top Bar Length: 24-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Bottom Bar Length: 25-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting for a clean, contemporary look.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2006_24.pdf?v=1691095370\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBN2006/24 24\" Double Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
